    Migrate away from deprecated ::set-output in GitHub Actions (#6437)
    
    GitHub deprecated the `::set-output` to pass on values to different
    taks. This patch migrated the create release workflow to using the new
    environment files.
    
    See
    https://github.blog/changelog/2022-10-11-github-actions-deprecating-save-state-and-set-output-commands/
    
    *This needs to go into `r/16.x` since the workflow is executed when
    cutting new releases.*
    
